<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41074" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕ-mūgĭo</span></b> ,
			īre, v. n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to bellow back; to resound</i>, <i>re-echo</i> (<b>poet.</b>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ad mea verba remugis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					1, 657</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sibylla antro remugit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 6, 99</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">totus remugit Mons,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 12, 928</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ionius remugiens sinus Noto,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					Epod. 10, 19</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nemus ventis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					C. 3, 10, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gemitu nemus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 12, 722</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nemus alio bellatore (i. e. tauro),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 12, 602</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nemus latratu,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Thyest. 675</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vox assensu nemornm ingeminata remugit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 3, 45</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sequitur clamor caelumque remugit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. A.
					9, 504</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">leve tympanum remugit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					63, 29</span></i>
			.</div>
